     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">謝謝WEPA的解說:)，我將矩陣轉化為sparseMatrix後此問題解決，非常謝謝您^^<div>想再請教幾個問題...以下是我做spatialprobit </div><div><br></div><div>1.想要做 sarprobit帶入的code<br><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">t1\r\n&lt;- read.csv(&quot;D:/probit/xexample.csv&quot;)  #資料夾檔案叫做t1</span><br></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">attach(t1)                      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">   </span><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Y &lt;-\r\ncbind(yturn)                   #</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:新細明體,serif\">設定</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">y變數 </span><br></p>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt\">X &lt;- cbind(<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt\">fixloss, jobloc, presdient, reelection, parliament,\r\nquantity, year, newtaipei, yilan, taoyuan, hsinchu, miaoli, taichung, changhua,\r\nnantou, yunlin, chiayi, tainan, kaohsiung, pingtung, taitung, hualien, keelungcity,\r\nhsinchucity, taichungcity, chiayicity, tainancity)</span>)    #</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:12pt;font-family:新細明體,serif\">設定</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:12pt\">x變數</span><br></div></span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><br></span></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">v2=read.csv(&quot;D:/probit/ww.csv &quot;,head=F)   #<u></u><u></u></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">W</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:新細明體,serif\">矩陣從資料夾輸出叫做</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">v2</span></p></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">library(Matrix) </span><br></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">v22=as.matrix(v2)    </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> #</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:新細明體,serif\">將</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">v2</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:新細明體,serif\">變成矩陣</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">v22</span><br></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">v222\r\n&lt;- <a href=\"http://inside-r.org/r-doc/methods/as\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://inside-r.org/r-doc/methods/as&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238062655000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eEcesQCYHZbjQ7M2QFS9n\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\">as</span></a>(v22,\r\n&quot;sparseMatrix&quot;)   #</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">把</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">v22</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">改為</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">sparseMatria</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">矩陣</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">v222</span><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">sarprobit.fit1\r\n&lt;- sar_probit_mcmc(Y, X, W=v222)  # 跑sarprobit model</span><br></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">summary(sarprobit.fit1)<br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">現在發生的問題是，因為我的x數值很多，如果不要放入那麼多數據可以跑出結果，但是全部跑的話會出現以下錯誤(50筆左右)，無法得出結果。我試過分批將變數放入都沒有問題，唯獨全部放或是否些組合下會出現錯誤。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">2: In max(ind) : max 中沒有無漏失的引數；回傳 -Inf</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">3: In max(ind) : max 中沒有無漏失的引數；回傳 -Inf</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">4: In max(ind) : max 中沒有無漏失的引數；回傳 -Inf</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">5: In max(ind) : max 中沒有無漏失的引數；回傳 -Inf</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">...</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">2.改試著使用semprobit</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">semprobit.fit1 &lt;- sem_probit_mcmc (Y, X,\r\nW=v222)<u></u><u></u></span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">summary(semprobit.fit1)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">改成出現以下錯誤(50筆)</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">2: In sqrt(zvar[ind0]) : 產生了 NaNs</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">3: In sqrt(zvar[ind1]) : 產生了 NaNs</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">4: In sqrt(zvar[ind0]) : 產生了 NaNs</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">......</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">但是仍然可以得出解果</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">想請教一下是否我在哪部分的設定有誤呢:)  謝謝^^</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">附件是我的y x w使用的數據 。 </p></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><br>在 2016年3月16日星期三 UTC+8下午10:52:25，WEPA ^_^写道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi Sasa,</div><div><br></div><div>此錯誤應該是W不是sparseMatrix物件, 參考以下說明:</div><div><br></div><div>1.查詢原始函數: 開啟RStudio視窗, 滑鼠停於sar_probit_mcmc函數任何位置, 按 CTRL + 左鍵 --&gt; 顯示函數內容.</div><div><br></div><div>2. 程式碼第20行顯示W資料物件必須繼承自sparseMatrix類別, 否則會顯示此錯誤.</div><div><br></div><div>3. 解決方法: W必須經過sparseMatrix{Matrix}轉換, ?sparseMatrix 查詢線上說明.</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-BVRZuq5JWMY/VulyNhNYb-I/AAAAAAAAKOE/hOJEPC5FWuU4iIPEdPpJdm3DI1CUJiSlA/s1600/sar_probit_mcmc_ERROR.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-BVRZuq5JWMY/VulyNhNYb-I/AAAAAAAAKOE/hOJEPC5FWuU4iIPEdPpJdm3DI1CUJiSlA/s1600/sar_probit_mcmc_ERROR.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238062655000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ePnwL0BCqMd8GzvXP7hlT\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-BVRZuq5JWMY/VulyNhNYb-I/AAAAAAAAKOE/hOJEPC5FWuU4iIPEdPpJdm3DI1CUJiSlA/s400/sar_probit_mcmc_ERROR.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"105\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"># end</p><br>簡沙拉於 2016年3月16日星期三 UTC+8下午9時30分31秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>想請問一下，我在使用spatialprobit套件 想要跑sarprobit時，我的W一直出現Error in sar_probit_mcmc(y, X, W, ...) : <br>  sarprobit: spatial weights matrix W must be a sparse matrix with zeros in the main diagonal</div><div>W矩陣的部分我是自己用excel key好轉成csv檔案匯入，也有用語法<font color=\"#000000\" face=\"新細明體\" size=\"3\">\r\n \r\n</font><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:#373e4d;background:#fefefe\">=as.matrix() 將矩陣改成martriax模式了(下圍為W檔案輸出的樣子)</span>\r\n，想請問我是否在哪一步驟沒有注意到有錯誤呢?謝謝\r\n。<b></b><i></i><u></u><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></div><div>      V1 V2  V3<br>[1,] 0.0  1 0.0<br>[2,] 0.5  0 0.5<br>[3,] 0.0  1 0.0</div></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
